message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
type: software
title: "Spartan backend for Noir (Tom-256)"
authors:
  - family-names: Gasser
    given-names: Linus
    affiliation: EPFL
  - family-names: Humbert
    given-names: Clément
    affiliation: SICPA
