doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23694668
repository-code: https://github.com/eid-privacy/spartan-backend
license:
  - MIT
  - Apache-2.0
abstract: >-
  Spartan prover backend for Noir over the Tom-256 curve, whose order equals the base
  field of P-256, so circuits verify ECDSA-P256 signatures natively. Includes the e-ID
  circuits (age proof on an unmodified SWIYU SD-JWT with ECDSA-P256 holder binding, SICPA
  Digital Trust Platform circuits), precomputation of the prover state, and benchmarks.
  Contains the fixes for the zkSecurity review.
keywords:
  - zero-knowledge proofs
  - Spartan
  - Noir
  - Tom-256
  - ECDSA
  - P-256
  - SD-JWT
  - e-ID
  - swiyu
  - holder binding
